<ol>
<li><a href="#sec-1">The verified weekly price</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-2">What the Vision buys for a week</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-3">Planning a weekly budget</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-4">The daily rate comparison</a></li>
